<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1442590153"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:27.587"><div begin="33.188" end="56.608" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="33.188" end="39.084" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="33.188" end="33.633">还</span><span begin="33.633" end="34.116">记</span><span begin="34.116" end="34.421">得</span><span begin="34.421" end="35.202">当天</span><span begin="35.202" end="35.971">旅</span><span begin="35.971" end="36.626">馆</span><span begin="36.626" end="37.370">的</span><span begin="37.872" end="38.274">门</span><span begin="38.274" end="39.084">牌</span></p><p begin="39.433" end="45.245" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="39.433" end="39.743">还</span><span begin="39.743" end="40.415">留住</span><span begin="40.415" end="41.295">笑着</span><span begin="41.295" end="41.918">离</span><span begin="41.918" end="42.724">开</span><span begin="42.724" end="43.524">的</span><span begin="43.844" end="44.258">神</span><span begin="44.258" end="45.245">态</span></p><p begin="45.781" end="50.898" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="45.781" end="46.149">当</span><span begin="46.149" end="46.554">天</span><span begin="46.554" end="47.191">整个</span><span begin="47.191" end="47.595">城</span><span begin="47.595" end="48.239">市</span> <span begin="48.497" end="48.866">那</span><span begin="48.866" end="49.268">样</span><span begin="49.483" end="49.938">轻</span><span begin="49.938" end="50.898">快</span></p><p begin="51.341" end="56.608" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="51.341" end="51.771">沿路</span><span begin="51.771" end="52.494">一起</span><span begin="52.494" end="52.952">走</span><span begin="52.952" end="53.295">半</span><span begin="53.295" end="53.972">哩</span><span begin="53.972" end="54.686">长</span><span begin="54.686" end="56.608">街</span></p></div><div begin="57.367" end="1:21.364" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="57.367" end="1:03.178" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="57.367" end="57.792">还</span><span begin="57.792" end="58.493">记得</span><span begin="58.493" end="59.185">街灯</span><span begin="59.185" end="59.903">照</span><span begin="59.903" end="1:00.473">出</span><span begin="1:00.751" end="1:01.695">一</span><span begin="1:01.695" end="1:02.248">脸</span><span begin="1:02.248" end="1:03.178">黄</span></p><p begin="1:03.326" end="1:09.385" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:03.326" end="1:03.721">还</span><span begin="1:03.721" end="1:04.205">燃</span><span begin="1:04.205" end="1:04.495">亮</span><span begin="1:04.495" end="1:05.297">那份</span><span begin="1:05.297" end="1:06.016">微</span><span begin="1:06.016" end="1:06.791">温</span><span begin="1:06.791" end="1:07.674">的</span><span begin="1:07.949" end="1:08.366">便</span><span begin="1:08.366" end="1:09.385">当</span></p><p begin="1:09.717" end="1:14.843" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:09.717" end="1:10.474">剪影</span><span begin="1:10.474" end="1:11.223">的你</span><span begin="1:11.223" end="1:11.709">轮</span><span begin="1:11.709" end="1:12.389">廓</span> <span begin="1:12.789" end="1:13.639">太</span><span begin="1:13.761" end="1:14.192">好</span><span begin="1:14.192" end="1:14.843">看</span></p><p begin="1:15.027" end="1:21.364" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:15.027" end="1:15.797">凝住</span><span begin="1:15.797" end="1:16.437">眼</span><span begin="1:16.437" end="1:16.986">泪</span><span begin="1:17.241" end="1:17.766">才</span><span begin="1:17.766" end="1:18.341">敢</span><span begin="1:18.341" end="1:18.994">细</span><span begin="1:18.994" end="1:21.364">看</span></p></div><div begin="1:23.862" end="1:47.682" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:23.862" end="1:29.668" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:23.862" end="1:24.397">忘</span><span begin="1:24.397" end="1:24.728">掉</span><span begin="1:24.728" end="1:25.120">天</span><span begin="1:25.120" end="1:25.682">地</span> <span begin="1:25.870" end="1:26.592">仿佛</span><span begin="1:26.592" end="1:26.990"